Client docs: `docs/INDEX.md`, `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`, `docs/DEVELOPMENT.md`.
Open backlog: `docs/DEVELOPMENT.md` only. Do not duplicate backlog in docs or rules.

Doc routing: behavior and topology -> `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`; dev, CI, backlog -> `docs/DEVELOPMENT.md`; engineering rules -> `.cursor/rules/*.mdc`. Do not duplicate agent rules into docs.

SLA and budgets

- Tracker `ad_http_request_duration_seconds`: p95 < 50 ms, p99 < 80 ms, ceiling 100 ms.
- Production `FILTER_TIMEOUT_MS` <= 100; dev default 5000 ms.
- Redis unified-filter Lua p99 < 10 ms per shard.
- Geo filter p99 < 10 us (sampled).
- `RunAuction` p99 < 15 us; p99 candidates scanned < 500.
- Fraud boost snapshot: incremental < 500 us per `FilterEngine.Check`; `BenchmarkFilterFraudBoost` ~90 ns, 0 allocs/op.
- `GetShard` (StaticSlot): ~5.6 ns, 0 allocs/op.
- Load-test abort: control-cohort p99 > 80 ms for 30 s or budget invariant violation.
- Budget invariant: `current_spend <= budget_limit` in Postgres; spend tests use `AssertBudgetInvariant` (+/-1 micro-unit).

Sources-only repo

Fresh clone is not runnable out of the box: run `make gen` / `make proto`, provide env/secrets, build BPF, fetch GeoIP, start compose. Do not commit generated code, `bin/*`, `.cache/`, `var/`, secrets, or runtime JWT files. Canonical ignore: root `.gitignore`. Local dev license path: `var/license.jwt` (not repo root `license.jwt`).

Commit policy

- Title: imperative, plain English; lead with Add, Remove, Fix, Wire, Drop, Guard, Reject; name concrete surface (route, handler, table, env var, binary).
- Avoid: `refactor:`, `docs:`, `chore:`, vague umbrellas (`perf`, `cleanup`, `misc`, `WIP`), milestone tokens (`M-…`, `GAP-…`).
- Body optional: why and what to verify; no file manifest.
- One logical change set per commit; no docs-only commits unless code ships in the same commit.

Rules (flat `.cursor/rules/`)

- `core.mdc`, `quality.mdc`, `anti-slop.mdc` — always on.
- `code-style.mdc` — layout, types, sqlc, proto, PR gates.
- `hot-path.mdc` — `/track`, parsers, gnet, SoA, asm, filters, 0 allocs.
- `cold-path.mdc` — admin, payment, ledger, notify; flat handlers, pkg/coldpath.
- `data-layer.mdc` — Redis StaticSlot, Postgres, ClickHouse.
- `boundaries.mdc` — `cmd/*` ownership and imports.
- `control-plane.mdc` — outbox, workers, admin API.
- `rtb.mdc`, `edge.mdc`, `compliance.mdc`, `fault-tests.mdc`, `testing.mdc`, `load-test-bpf.mdc`.

Precedence: `core.mdc` on SLA and repo policy; `anti-slop.mdc` on CI honesty and test/UI gates; `testing.mdc` on test taxonomy, holdouts, edge-case matrix; `hot-path.mdc` on ingest; `cold-path.mdc` on notify/payment/ledger/controlplane; `code-style.mdc` on structure; `boundaries.mdc` on imports.
